# Kineflex Player Routing Rules for Netlify

# 1. Typo correction: redirect /move/* to /movie/*
/move/*     /movie/:splat    301!

# 2. Movie routing: rewrite /movie/:id to /player.html (HTTP 200 keeps URL clean in browser)
/movie/*    /player.html     200

# 3. TV show routing: rewrite /tv/:id/:season/:episode to /player.html
/tv/*       /player.html     200

# 4. Direct play prefix routing
/play=*     /player.html     200

# 5. Root & static files:
# Netlify automatically serves index.html at "/" and static assets from posters/, data/, etc.
